# OpenCV face models for the reaction-GIF cut (YuNet + SFace, ~38MB).
# Fetched from the opencv_zoo release, not carried in the repo:
#   https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models
# The image build bakes in whatever sits here, so a fresh clone needs them
# downloaded before `scripts/deploy.sh` or every gif skips with
# "face models missing from assets/models".
backend/assets/models/
